WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:34.320
Ideon's new weapon, the Wave Leader Gun,

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:38.180
sunk the alien Daram Zuba's fleet in an instant.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:44.290
The Ideon also rescued Sheryl, who was
taken prisoner by the Earth Union Military.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:51.400
Having been abandoned by Earth, the
 Solo Ship is now a vagrant of space.

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:59.550
<b>Swords of Light</b>

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:17.320
We're behind schedule loading
 the missiles and ammunition!

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:19.020
What's the status with the rations?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.820
This is Lotta! We've just sent
 the shipments from Dome 26!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.120
The missiles are still armed! Take it easy!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.840
Get back on!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.940
We need to survey our surroundings.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.210
The remaining Moonland soldiers
 might come to hinder us again.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:57.320
Aren't we already doing that?

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:58.880
What, you're not sure?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.040
I'm pretty sure.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:00.610
Bes!

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:01.700
What is it?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.400
We've finished fixing the Ideo-Delta.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.140
What should we do next?

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.730
Start working on that Ideon Gun.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.830
Roger!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.580
Watch out for the Moonland people.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.280
Roger!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.080
I'm trying it again!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.880
Okay, go ahead!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.630
What is this?

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.290
We're investigating the direction of the energy flow.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.650
That looks just like a Glen Cannon!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.760
Is that the way the Ide works too, Sheryl?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.930
I wonder if it's safe to fiddle around with this...

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.690
What do you mean?

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.160
We found the Ideon Gun hidden inside the Solo Ship...

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.910
If we use it wrong, it might bring only misfortune for us.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.840
Have some confidence!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:51.820
Sheryl, Earth has cast us aside! 
We need to stay confident if we want to survive!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:53.820
Isn't that so?

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:57.430
So please don't say things like that.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.540
You'll make everyone anxious.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.260
That's right.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.220
I'm sorry, Cosmo. I'll take care.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:05.800
Please do that.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.130
You're an important person
 to the Solo Ship, you know.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.010
You flatter me.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:19.150
Meanwhile, the fleet of Rukuku Kil of the Buff Clan...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.990
materialized several light years away from Earth.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.170
They had been guided there by Daram Zuba.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.790
Hurry and recover Daram Zuba's capsule!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:46.000
Yes ma'am! Hatch 6, have you located the target?

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:49.540
The Orme Foundation's pet dog...

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.760
Hatch 6, we've found it!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.360
This is commander Rukuku Kil.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.730
I know. Never mind that.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:11.200
Fine. Thanks to you, we didn't have
 to waste time wandering around.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:17.330
Good work. Let me hand over the battle
 data we have gathered on the Giant .

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.160
You'll guarantee that
I'll get my payment, right?

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:23.620
I promise. You're more calculating than you look.

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:29.200
I do what I must to survive.
 Now, I'd like to have some drinks.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.580
Very well.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.640
This has to be a gravitational tremor!
 Do you know how many there are?

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.080
Seven or eight...

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.380
Allies or enemies?

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.150
At least they're not emitting a friendly signal.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.830
What about the radio?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.120
They won't answer.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.690
Any response from Earth?

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.720
There's no answer at all.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.730
They even abandoned everyone on Moonland.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.920
What's that over there?

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.500
There are lots of shining obejcts above the Earth.

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:55.370
Hatari, do you know?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.330
They're missile satellites. They
 can even stop sub-light missiles.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.550
What's going on?!

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.360
The Earth is only holding back and
 waiting for us and the Buff Clan to leave.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.070
But the Buff Clan is ready for battle.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.640
Defending won't be enough alone.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:12.150
We need to use force.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.310
We won't stand a chance otherwise.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.720
Karala, please.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:16.800
Yes.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:17.980
<i>Calling all hands!</i>

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.440
Take care. I'm going over to help Kasha.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.230
<i>The enemy is approaching!</i>

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.750
<i>Load the materials quickly!</i>

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.360
Yeah!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.510
<i>Pilots, get ready to sortie!</i>

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.780
It's moving!

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.480
Ashura, stop it!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:34.820
Lou, are you scared?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.700
Good, let's go! Ideon, launch!

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:37.700
I'm scared!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:42.780
We're going to the Ideon!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.390
It's the pilot's seat! Alright!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.720
It's an expedition!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.060
There, there. Isn't it pretty?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.860
What's up with this light?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.270
Hey! Heads up!

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:10.070
What?!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.240
The energy is rising!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.750
Do you hear that sound?

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:18.580
Sheryl!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:19.700
Look at the Ideon Gun!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.590
The energy is flowing in!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.240
Did you figure out how it works?

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.890
No, we don't know!

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:27.750
The energy just suddenly went up...

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.480
This is our chance!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.930
Now that the energy is flowing, Cosmo and
 the others can find out where it comes from!

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:35.840
Kasha! The missiles are all loaded!

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:36.880
Roger!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.250
What are you doing?!

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.170
Stop! They're not the Buff Clan!

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:47.920
Where are they?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.780
You traitors!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.170
We won't let you take anything from Moonland!

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.950
They're survivors from Moonland!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.870
We're not aliens!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:57.700
Stop it!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.990
This isn't the time for infighting! Stop it!

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:06.000
Better blow them up than let them have anything!

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.110
Why?

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:15.540
Those people from Moonland are trying
 to prevent us from resupplying!

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:16.690
Why now?

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:21.030
Just when we were searching the relation
 between the Ideon and the gun's energy...

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.020
Stop it!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:25.100
Fellow Earthlings shouldn't fight against each other!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:28.360
If this goes on, the Ide will destroy us all! Stop it!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.350
Stay down!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.570
Stop it!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.110
We shouldn't be doing this!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.280
You have to stop!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.900
The Ide's power will be released! Therefore...

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.860
Please stop!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.440
Don't stop me!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.540
Just deal with the ones that broke in!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.670
Please stop! Stop...

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.040
Die!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:57.000
We need to make them stop!

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.100
That's impossible! They won't listen!

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:02.000
That was far too reckless...
 You musn't throw your life away!

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.190
Hide over there.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.650
You...

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.060
You're...

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.440
Who are you?

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.980
Gije. Gije Zaral!

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.030
I'm sorry!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.560
I can't let you die or raise a racket here.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:33.000
Is that the new model with the Geru Field?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.930
I don't need to send all of my
 forces to take down one giant.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.800
I hope you're right.

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.100
Primary battle group, launch!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.950
Subspace disturbance located!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.160
There's four vessels! Raise the alarm!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.210
Okay! Calling all hands!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.870
Get into battle positions! The Buff Clan is coming!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.870
The Buff Clan is coming!

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.190
Stop fighting amongst your own!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:14.530
Help us fight the aliens!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.580
Transfer the missiles to the center of the ship!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.290
Is this the Ide's power?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.300
The enemy has come! Pull back!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.200
Here they come!

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.190
Bes! Let's launch the Ideon!

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.640
Drive off the Moonland soldiers!

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:50.400
Start the engine!

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:51.510
Roger!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.960
What's that?!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.570
It's that new model, Adigo!

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.400
It's finally been completed...

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:20.930
Bes!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.070
Please launch the Ideon at once!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.640
These are only small crafts,
 but there's a new model coming!

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.900
What? You know about them?

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:27.640
Yes.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.760
They're fast and equipped with
 powerful particle cannons!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.320
Powerful particle cannons?

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.910
I've seen them being tested.

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:36.760
Got it.

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:38.790
Cosmo, Kasha, Moera! Hurry up!

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:49.050
It's the Buff Clan!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.190
The Ideo-Delta hasn't launched yet!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.940
What's wrong, Cosmo?!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.420
The enemy is high in number!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.380
So it seems!

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:24.510
I'm taking out the Ideo-Nova!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.590
Those bastards are fast!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.060
One down!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.530
Direct hit to the wheat field!

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:46.790
The barrier is breaking!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.030
What?!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.410
Isn't the barrier working?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.240
Hatari!

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.290
That can't be!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.980
The Ide's power is on the rise!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.540
What's going on?

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.120
Bes!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.790
The children are missing!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.920
Do you know where they are?!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:12:59.670
Who?

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.010
Lou, Ashura and Fard, all three!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:02.920
All three kids?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:03.880
Bes! Let's go!

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.980
Those are some aggressive enemies!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.110
Go down!

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.650
Change! Ideo-Delta!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.030
I won't let you have your way!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.280
Cosmo! Kasha! Let's hurry up and dock!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.660
Kasha! The enemies are fast!
We'll dock all at once!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:13:59.650
Roger!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:22.960
Damn you!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.970
Is the barrier getting stronger?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.600
The beams are being reflected back!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.600
That's a big help to us!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.310
Moera! Full power!

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:42.770
Roger!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.360
Good, let's go!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.740
Simultaneous missile attack!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:03.620
They dodged!

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:04.710
What a machine!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.160
It's way different from the bigger ones.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:10.800
Lou?!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.970
Deck, leave the controls to Moera!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.180
Keep firing the missiles!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.160
What's going on, Cosmo?!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.520
Lou and Ashura have snuck in!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.230
You can't just board the Ideon all by yourselves.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.440
Sit in a chair, it's dangerous here!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.590
Make more room for me!

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:30.070
But...

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.780
Hold on to him tightly!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.370
What are you doing?!

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:38.880
Moera! Kasha! We're being pushed back!

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.160
The enemies are too fast!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.480
They're nimble because they're so small!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.380
Are you hurt?

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.270
Gije... Gije Zaral?

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:03.010
I'm still living in dishonor.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:08.190
Why would a spy put me in
storage aboard the Solo Ship?!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.650
Because I want to know! About the Ide...

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:14.210
If you're going to kill me, just do it at once!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.950
If I meant to do that, I would have ages ago!

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.240
I want to talk to you. Don't raise your voice so loud.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.500
How dare you...

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.500
How can you say that?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.790
You are correct...

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.550
I've failed heavily time and time again.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:37.390
But the more I fought the Giant, Ideon,

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.600
the more I wanted to know
about the Ideon and the Ide.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.600
And that's why I don't care if I live in shame.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.670
I want you to teach me what
you know about the Ide,

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.090
Formossa Sheryl.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.070
What are you going to do once you know?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.860
It doesn't matter.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:57.570
But if the Ide will show us an
 altruistic power, I wish to see it.

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:00.240
Show us an altruistic power?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.580
A force for good?

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:04.910
Isn't that so?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.580
Are you the altruistic power?

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.290
Or is it the Buff Clan?

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:10.670
No...

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:16.380
Maybe both of us are evil, or maybe we're good.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.100
That's what I want to know!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:41.020
Our power is rising too! Don't mess with me!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.970
Spread the Geru Field.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.480
It's all over now, Daram.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.170
I knew you could do it.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.400
What the?!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.500
See that, Daram?

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:33.840
We'll simply seize the Giant and
 bring it to Supreme Commander Doba.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:37.130
Your skills are beyond compare, Lady Rukuku.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.430
No way could a private army like the
Orme Foundation do something like this.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.270
What about the pilots inside?

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.100
They'll be dead in a couple of minutes.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.330
What is that stream of light?!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.570
I don't know!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:40.320
I've never seen that!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.160
What's that light?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.000
It's coming from the Ideon!

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.920
The Ideon's glowing?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:54.960
What the?!

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.710
Lou! Piper Lou!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.260
Cosmo, it's energy!

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.730
From the arms, it's coming from the arms!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.420
Move the arms around, Cosmo!

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.120
Bes, what was the glow from the Ideon just now?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.140
I don't know. What can it be?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.380
It definitely appeared to
extend from both of it's arms...

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.000
Is this yet another new power from the Ideon?

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.970
Have our first attack wave retreat!

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:52.150
It's dangerous to get close to that Giant!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:56.450
Laugh all you want, Daram Zuba.
 I've been completely defeated.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.980
No, I can't laugh...

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:02.400
I've never seen the Giant fight like that.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.110
It wasn't in the data!

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:08.530
It could be a manifestion of the Ide...

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:09.910
What was that?

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:21.700
Are you alright, Lou?

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.670
Ashura, Fard, wake up!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.470
Piper Lou...

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:33.200
Perhaps we were saved because of you.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:34.180
Thank you.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.980
Once we return to Moonland,
 get all the machines inspected!

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:45.620
Continue anti-air surveillance!

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:55.750
I might still change my mind, understand?

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:57.790
I don't mind.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:02.700
Whether I live or die is up to you.
 I am nothing but a prisoner now.

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:09.680
I'm still grateful to you for saving my life.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:12.430
Thank you.

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:15.100
No...

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:26.070
Have I become completely shameless?

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:34.480
Was the glow from the Ideon's arms
a manifestation of the Ide's power?

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.860
Yet another person has come aboard the Solo Ship.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:43.710
But what does that foretell?

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:53.050
<i>Despite cutting ties with the Earth Union,</i>

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:56.160
<i>the Solo Ship cannot overlook
 the Buff Clan's attack on Earth.</i>

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:00.350
<i>The Ideon resorts to using the Wave Leader
Gun when hit with a Freezer attack.</i>

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:04.650
<i>The cornered Daram challenges Cosmo to a duel.</i>

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:08.400
<i>However, there is a traitor among them.</i>

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:11.910
<i>Next time, on Legendary Giant Ideon:</i>

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:17.540
<b>The Desperate Sniper</b>

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:17.540
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:17.190
<i><i>Space Runaway!</i></i>

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:35.560
tatta hitotsu no hoshi ni suterare

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:35.560
<i>I've been abandoned merely by one world</i>

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:42.900
owarinai tabi kimi to ayumu to

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:42.900
<i>As I walk this endless journey together with you</i>

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:48.450
itsukushimi futo wakeatte

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:48.450
<i>We unexpectedly share our affection</i>

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:55.830
kizu wo nameau douke shibai

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:55.830
<i>Feeling sympathy for each other in this farcical play</i>

00:23:56.160 --> 00:24:01.920
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:23:56.160 --> 00:24:01.920
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:08.510
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:08.510
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

